{v:'VER',what:'party1, his yes to style scoring (37): a combo ring drains at the cursor while a chain is live; a long shot, a melee kill, a grenade double, a burst of three and thirty untouched seconds each pay a bonus and a medal plate; a plain kill pays only the kill',
 run:function(){
